DESCRIPTION:Cali Pathways Project Spring Showcase 1\nCali Pathways student
 s take the stage to share their growth\, talent\, and hard work through m
 usic.\nThe Cali School of Music at Montclair State University aims to cre
 ate dynamic and comprehensive pathways to higher education and careers in
  music for under-resourced students. Our goal is to empower these young m
 usicians to pursue their dreams and to make higher education more accessi
 ble.\n\nHosted by: The College of the Arts\n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12457917
